+    '',
+    '## VLM Execution',
+    '',
+    `- Status: ${packet.vlm_execution.status}`,
+    `- Output packet exists: ${output !== null}`,
+    `- Lack of VLM access blocks issue completion: ${packet.vlm_execution.lack_of_vlm_access_blocks_issue}`,
+    '',
+    '## Boundary',
+    '',
+    '- No acceptance, rights approval, student-display eligibility, SourceVisualReceipt approval, QuestionRenderModel approval, Method Map promotion, ProcedureModel promotion, ProcedureStep promotion, scoring, or official mark-scheme truth is created.',
